Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is bringing back the mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:05.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few winters from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.62,0:00:06.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're standing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:07.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at a fence in the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:09.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There's a small hand in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:10.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And behind the fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the animal from the poster
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.29,0:00:13.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}above that child's bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lifts its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.21,0:00:16.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Red-brown fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:17.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Small ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.77,0:00:19.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Breath steaming in the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:23.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That animal doesn't exist yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:25.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Between an elephant and a mammoth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}there are about 1.4 million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}differences in their DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which ones make a mammoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.89,0:00:32.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No human can check them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.08,0:00:34.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No lab can change them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the search for the few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:38.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that matter went to a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the first test animals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:41.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are already alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Mice...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.35,0:00:43.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with long, woolly,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}mammoth-style fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:47.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The mice were the rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The real job is an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the same tools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.29,0:00:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will help decide which
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:53.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of today's animals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:55.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that child still gets to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:00:58.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The mice belong to a company
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in Dallas called Colossal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And its plan is not to thaw
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.42,0:01:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}out a frozen mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.41,0:01:05.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The plan is to take
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the mammoth's living cousin,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.47,0:01:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Asian elephant...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:11.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and rewrite its DNA for the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the machine's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:14.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}part in that plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.85,0:01:16.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As reported this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:17.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:19.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}helps comb through mammoth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:20.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and elephant DNA...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and flag the differences
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.11,0:01:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}most likely to build a trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.49,0:01:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The thick fur.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.61,0:01:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The layer of fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The small ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.46,0:01:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It doesn't change a single gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.74,0:01:32.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It writes the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.87,0:01:34.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it has plenty to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:36.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Frozen ground kept mammoth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}DNA for thousands of years...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.03,0:01:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and Colossal says it now holds
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:42.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about 100 mammoth genomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:45.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}100 full sets of DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:47.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So why is there still no mammoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:49.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because reading
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was never the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Knowing what it means is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.28,0:01:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Start the count at 1.4 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.19,0:01:58.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most of those differences probably
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.90,0:02:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}change nothing you would ever see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.98,0:02:02.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only some of them change
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:03.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what a gene actually builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:05.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One study found those
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.29,0:02:07.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in about 1,600 genes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.49,0:02:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still far too many to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:10.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is where the machine's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ranking comes in...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the count drops again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal's own list,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by the latest reports?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}About 150 genes...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.82,0:02:19.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:21.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And tested in a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}living animal so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only in those mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Seven genes, changed at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.41,0:02:29.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Critics add a caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:30.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Genes like these were already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.98,0:02:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}known to change a mouse's coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.26,0:02:35.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the mice prove the editing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From seven genes in a mouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to about 150 in an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:42.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the man who runs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:43.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal, Ben Lamm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:44.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has every reason
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to promise that a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will close that gap overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:00.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:02.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nothing overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:02.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machine doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:04.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hand over a mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.67,0:03:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It hands over a short list...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and somebody has to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But how would a machine even
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.07,0:03:11.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}know which differences matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:13.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the mammoth, Colossal has
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.66,0:03:15.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not shown that step in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This October, it did...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:18.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for a different animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:19.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:20.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The dodo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the dodo is the harder case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:25.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the mammoth, there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.21,0:03:26.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are about 100 genomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.17,0:03:28.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For the dodo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}there is exactly one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:30.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:32.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nothing to compare it with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:34.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So where does a machine begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:36.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal says its model,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.71,0:03:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}called GenoMorph,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:40.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}studied more than 70
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.30,0:03:41.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}living bird species...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:43.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}their DNA, and the exact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}shape of their skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:46.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is how it learned which
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}switches in the DNA shape a beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.33,0:03:51.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then it turned to the dodo...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.49,0:03:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and came back with about
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}2,300 candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}2,300 places in the DNA that might
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have shaped that famous beak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:02.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Might.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal itself says
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this is not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:07.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every candidate still has
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:08.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to prove itself in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:11.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So that is how a machine finds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the differences that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It doesn't know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It learns them...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from animals that are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Today, the machine writes a list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.43,0:04:22.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machines that follow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}will be asked for far more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:26.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.05,0:04:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.91,0:04:29.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.05,0:04:30.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:32.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.01,0:04:35.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A list is not an animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.86,0:04:36.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Somebody still has to grow one...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.11,0:04:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and a bird grows in an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This spring, the company says,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.22,0:04:44.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}live chicks hatched from an egg
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}no bird ever laid...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:48.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a see-through skin,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}held in a 3D-printed shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.67,0:04:53.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So suppose all of it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every pick, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:57.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is the animal that walks out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a mammoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.98,0:05:00.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There is a way to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three animals made by editing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a living relative
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.44,0:05:04.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are already alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.11,0:05:07.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Romulus, Remus and Khaleesi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal presented
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}them as dire wolves...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a wolf that died out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:15.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They began as gray wolf cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.60,0:05:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}20 edits went in...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.19,0:05:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}guided by DNA from a tooth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.02,0:05:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}13,000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Colossal says the oldest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are now two years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.98,0:05:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}healthy, and hunting as a pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So are they dire wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Wolf experts at the union behind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Red List of threatened
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:37.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}species say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And Colossal's own
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:39.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chief scientist,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.66,0:05:41.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Beth Shapiro, has said
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.12,0:05:42.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}plainly what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}"Our animals are gray wolves
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with 20 edits that are cloned."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is what "bringing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}back" means today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.03,0:05:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The traits come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.55,0:05:53.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The species does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it tells you what would
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.35,0:05:56.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}really stand behind that fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An Asian elephant...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:05:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a mammoth's fur,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:00.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fat, and small ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An elephant built for the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:04.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And not soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first calf was once
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:08.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}promised for 2028.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now Colossal says
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the early 2030s...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and its chief executive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:15.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}says there is no hard date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a hope, not a timetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So far, nobody has reported
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.75,0:06:25.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a mammoth embryo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:26.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or a pregnant elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And an elephant carries her
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}calf for almost two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So is one shaggy elephant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.93,0:06:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}years behind schedule,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}really what all of this is for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:38.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bigger prize is the animals
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.53,0:06:41.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that are still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:44.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the mammoth itself shows why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The last mammoths died
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}only about 4,000 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a remote island in the Arctic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The great pyramids of Egypt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:53.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}were already standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.41,0:06:55.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But nobody was there to freeze
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.05,0:06:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a single living cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.98,0:06:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The ice kept only broken DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.33,0:07:01.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is why every trait
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has to be rebuilt...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:04.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}difference by difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:06.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now take an American
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:08.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}animal that got luckier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:09.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the 1980s,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.65,0:07:11.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}somebody froze living cells
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.46,0:07:12.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from a black-footed
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ferret named Willa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Decades later,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:17.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}those cells became living clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.78,0:07:18.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}According to U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.57,0:07:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wildlife officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of them had babies
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}two years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:23.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and last year, her babies
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:25.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}had babies of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A ferret from the 1980s...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.67,0:07:28.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:30.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No short list.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.35,0:07:31.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No guesswork.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just a freezer, opened in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:37.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now scale that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The U.S. government and Colossal
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.89,0:07:39.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}plan to freeze cells
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:41.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from every species
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:43.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the country's endangered list.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:44.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the genomes are meant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:47.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to go online, free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A freezer is not a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:51.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It protects no habitat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:52.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But think about what the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine learns from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:55.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:57.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every genome saved is one more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:07:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lesson in which
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:07:59.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}differences matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:00.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every species
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:01.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that vanishes unread...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.93,0:08:03.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a lesson gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Even the mammoth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.19,0:08:06.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}depends on the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.78,0:08:07.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its mother would be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an Asian elephant...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and her species is endangered too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.22,0:08:13.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In North American zoos,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:14.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the leading killer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:16.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of her calves is a virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This summer, researchers reported
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.24,0:08:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a vaccine that Colossal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}helped pay for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:23.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Two young elephants who
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.49,0:08:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}got it caught the virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and came through
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}without treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Two calves are a first
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sign, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:33.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the road to a mammoth begins
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with keeping elephants alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the elephant is not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:39.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year's Red List counts about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}50,000 species as threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So here is what the evidence says.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.78,0:08:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Artificial intelligence is helping
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to bring back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the mammoth's traits...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:51.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in an elephant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not the mammoth itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.58,0:08:54.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The mammoth draws the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.50,0:08:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cameras and the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.24,0:08:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rescue itself happens
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:58.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}somewhere quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:00.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a freezer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.16,0:09:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and in a machine that is learning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to read what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So stand at that fence once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:08.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe, in the early 2030s,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:09.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}there really is a small
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:10.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hand in yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and an elephant in a mammoth's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:14.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}coat lifts its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Should it ever walk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:18.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}free on the tundra?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:19.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Last year, the union
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.89,0:09:21.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}behind the Red List voted
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a pause for genetically
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}modified wild animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The pause failed...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.89,0:09:28.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by a single vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.93,0:09:30.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who decides?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:32.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whatever the answer,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the prize was never one mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.98,0:09:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is that child, grown up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a world where elephants,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.75,0:09:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ferrets, and thousands
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.15,0:09:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of others are still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not just on a poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The mammoth is the poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The freezer is the ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}These films exist
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:52.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:53.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence goes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}well for everybody...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:55.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and for everything
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that lives here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:58.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.71,0:09:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
